{"schema_version":1,"status":"complete","epoch":"zhcn-67f8551f7780","task_id":"batch-01448-s03","batch":1448,"shard":3,"source_commit":"67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835","source_queue_git_commit":"ba3815ed06a2a9bb3fddb38a6e1ea7ca64506da2","shard_start":60,"shard_end_exclusive":80,"translated_count":20,"entries":[{"entry_index":60,"uid":"zhcn:6bd147491a001fff711ffe42","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"无论付出了多少努力，\r\n只要没有留下好成绩，\r\n就无法获得别人的关注。","source_fingerprint":"70b748660c4d311432595b5f7332250eb9b0c810c691d834996a6d2ddb184047","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1087","20031"],"target_text":"Dù đã nỗ lực đến đâu,\r\nnếu không để lại thành tích tốt,\r\nthì cũng không thể khiến người khác chú ý.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":61,"uid":"zhcn:887528aa1ae69c7e75fa9a12","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"即便状态调整得并不完美，\r\n但也已经走到这一步了。\r\n……我要为今天的奔跑留下意义。","source_fingerprint":"43496780d09178243d11018f6fe95ce6c1e22f23eba3562e2d54566e930ce4ea","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1087","20032"],"target_text":"Dù trạng thái chưa được điều chỉnh hoàn hảo,\r\nnhưng tôi đã đi đến tận đây rồi.\r\n...Tôi phải khiến cuộc chạy hôm nay trở nên có ý nghĩa.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":62,"uid":"zhcn:1d9d684b1cdb5c6814fbc441","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"我可以在休息室检查蹄铁吗？\r\n虽然应该没问题……\r\n但我想再检查一次。","source_fingerprint":"902a30922bbf14a21a005639481200ab96cf38d47f78453d0096983225276fe7","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1087","20033"],"target_text":"Tôi có thể kiểm tra móng ngựa trong phòng nghỉ không?\r\nChắc là không có vấn đề gì...\r\nnhưng tôi muốn kiểm tra thêm một lần nữa.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":63,"uid":"zhcn:f24e35919a5234914bb488de","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"我心里还是会有不安。\r\n但这不代表我可以在这里落败。","source_fingerprint":"a7f53a323d450ff3e550c0fd63e1dc2b67d6fa71215a5077a275fa975805b34f","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1087","20034"],"target_text":"Trong lòng tôi vẫn còn bất an.\r\nNhưng điều đó không có nghĩa là tôi được phép thua ở đây.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":64,"uid":"zhcn:ee919b71a23f51497c263fbe","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"……心脏跳得好快，真是碍事。\r\n冷静下来吧，一定没问题的。","source_fingerprint":"cf84016f9080b59062de4f330625ff09c8a7a71ae4c577e8b655e480a16eb5ca","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1087","20035"],"target_text":"...Tim đập nhanh quá, thật vướng víu.\r\nBình tĩnh lại nào, nhất định sẽ ổn thôi.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":65,"uid":"zhcn:75f01233c246274de8a1ab12","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"我会竭尽全力，直到最后一刻。\r\n……我不想就这样、被埋没。","source_fingerprint":"618adc31235593e022f27fe2a777e429feb427fbf3b93d1b30d425489135a865","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1087","20036"],"target_text":"Tôi sẽ dốc hết sức cho đến giây phút cuối cùng.\r\n...Tôi không muốn cứ thế bị chôn vùi.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":66,"uid":"zhcn:905ab4a52a8cfdfc609b915f","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"难受时才更要站稳脚步。\r\n这是关键的一战。\r\n只要撑过去就会有商机。","source_fingerprint":"1b2f37a32788353eac269b4360b7883fc6b9bbc917b6754e8f455f34a2cb9bb8","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1087","20037"],"target_text":"Càng khó chịu càng phải đứng vững.\r\nĐây là một trận đấu then chốt.\r\nChỉ cần vượt qua thì cơ hội sẽ mở ra.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":67,"uid":"zhcn:170af68d151f6c98178c973b","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"好～","source_fingerprint":"055afe339cd4865e65ab35abd460bf34d7042d1791d77a932832ea2d4f7e30bc","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1087","20038"],"target_text":"Được~","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":68,"uid":"zhcn:0ab7aa6ef3469a19449ded69","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"嗯。","source_fingerprint":"5c7a9f97adb5bed9d4c6aca666dffd0e37fda970ebcfc2c8c0060523a483e295","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1087","20039"],"target_text":"Ừ.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":69,"uid":"zhcn:4efb765eaf4a4e1d07520fce","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"要开始了。","source_fingerprint":"50f188e86f3a8e4b11e3889195a5e78696dec7efbbec196eb54940fe3288b9a8","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1087","20040"],"target_text":"Bắt đầu thôi.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":70,"uid":"zhcn:e3451ba14efa6c424c039a77","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"来念书吧。","source_fingerprint":"56a8ab96367f1fecd8a5597a31d41e49058a905ae254b66853db9c081ae88db3","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1087","20041"],"target_text":"Học bài nào.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":71,"uid":"zhcn:b3d9a1c591effd3da23a283e","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"哎呀呀……","source_fingerprint":"ff2fc41fc2a37ee08441f40c67d9ba7a9c82aa96fa79524ef44330e764709db9","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1087","20042"],"target_text":"Ối chà...","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":72,"uid":"zhcn:8b17a27301cdc7902f682194","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"咦？","source_fingerprint":"86da1b53b8e9030921223d1116840eec3ad77bbe410b4f3802da0abd63a8d247","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1087","20043"],"target_text":"Hả?","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":73,"uid":"zhcn:8fe8863d1701f00cd26d269c","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"要出门了呀。","source_fingerprint":"382de79e5af87cfa84fea453698c0c59f570bac174669c44123c53cce6f366b6","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1087","20046"],"target_text":"Sắp ra ngoài rồi nhỉ.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":74,"uid":"zhcn:69539829490edf894a2f9a57","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"哦哦，是大海……！","source_fingerprint":"f264985c2db982e72c4077c46e7dc57047b700dec1756517127b77c9d5fb65ff","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1087","20047"],"target_text":"Ồ, biển kìa...!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":75,"uid":"zhcn:97714f324704a67dde814426","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"我觉得留下了美好的回忆。","source_fingerprint":"6b1ed91bf8b9fd0e47d8593bda3a938c7c56cde182112eb687c13bdaf1ba1d09","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1087","20049"],"target_text":"Tôi nghĩ mình đã có những kỷ niệm đẹp.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":76,"uid":"zhcn:db69b4a6170af3aa78340b46","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"训练员也辛苦了。","source_fingerprint":"60cea5bec86c043fd19dbea36436c0f3b9c4fe2202fcdb74cfb046ace865c13f","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1087","20050"],"target_text":"Trainer cũng vất vả rồi.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":77,"uid":"zhcn:948250f012f32942f63b6e2e","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"帮手小真登场。","source_fingerprint":"ece2e686b5ec3c4a914c99658ff232de8b8334c78da9fa3d3e5f000937b7fe20","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1087","20051"],"target_text":"Trợ thủ Machan xuất hiện.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":78,"uid":"zhcn:2204643352da3428b3d5f947","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"那么，我们走吧。","source_fingerprint":"61a54c3e0a4c22fa18eec40b86616d9118dd4aacb049d8ce94a1df739a4dfd66","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1087","2030"],"target_text":"Vậy, chúng ta đi thôi.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":79,"uid":"zhcn:805ae8094bb808a441c92417","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"看来大家都到齐了。","source_fingerprint":"72851e94c3f899ed022c2d4757cf5498bac92a8c408510eddeed0fe09b52603b","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1087","2031"],"target_text":"Có vẻ mọi người đã đến đủ rồi.","reviewed":true}]}